<div class="prose-block">
  <p>Print Legion is a Hack Club program that allows participants for a YSWS or a hackathon to receive 3D printed parts from fellow Hack Clubbers around the world! Any one requiring a print can post a request for one in <a class="hl" href="<%= ApplicationHelper::SLACK_CHANNEL %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">#printing-legion</a>. This document is for event organizers to plan around using Print Legion as a part of their program!</p>
</div>
<div class="prose-block">
  <p><b>Print Legion is funded by grants from your program's HCB</b></p>
  <ul>
    <li>For hardware/CAD related YSWS, you need to provide your participants funding for their prints on an HCB grant card! You will need to add the Print Legion HCB (printlegion@hackclub.com) to your program's org to allow me to deduct funds for prints. Funds will be removed from the recipient's grant card, and subsequently transferred to the Print Legion HCB org. Prints will cost $50 per kg + shipping costs to the recipient! Median shipping costs are $4 per order.</li>
    <li>For satellite events and hackathons, you can request an order in #printing-legion on behalf of your program directly. Once shipped, you are required to transfer the cost from your event's HCB org into Print Legion's HCB org (<a class="hl-link" href="https://hcb.hackclub.com/printing-legion" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://hcb.hackclub.com/printing-legion</a>). Prints will cost $50 per kg + shipping costs.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
<h3>A Message on Cost</h3>
<div class="prose-block">
  <p>Print Legion as a program does not have it's own income stream! The $50/kg might appear steep, but this cost is used to provide Hack Clubbers with prizes and incentives. All funds are recirculated to keep the program running!</p>
</div>
